## 🔐 Authentication & Authorization

### Authentication Flow

```
1. User visits app
   ↓
2. AuthProvider checks for cookies (user_token or admin_token)
   ↓
3. If token exists → Call /api/v1/auth/me
   ↓
4. Set user state + isAuthenticated flag
   ↓
5. Route guards redirect based on auth state
```

### Using Authentication in Components

```jsx
import useAuth from '../../services/hooks/auth/useAuth';

function MyComponent() {
  const { user, isAuthenticated, isLoading, login, logout, refreshUser } = useAuth();
  
  if (isLoading) {
    return <div className="flex h-screen items-center justify-center">
      <Spinner />
    </div>;
  }
  
  if (!isAuthenticated) {
    return <Navigate to="/auth/login" />;
  }
  
  return (
    <div>
      <p>Welcome, {user?.name}</p>
      <button onClick={logout}>Logout</button>
    </div>
  );
}
```

### Route Guards Implementation

**RequireAuth** - Redirects to `/auth/login` if not authenticated

```jsx
// src/ui/guards/RequireAuth.jsx
import { Navigate, Outlet } from "react-router";
import useAuth from "../../services/hooks/auth/useAuth";

export default function RequireAuth({ children }) {
  const { isAuthenticated, isLoading } = useAuth();
  
  if (isLoading) {
    return (
      <div className="flex h-screen items-center justify-center text-muted-foreground">
        Loading...
      </div>
    );
  }
  
  if (!isAuthenticated) {
    return <Navigate to="/auth/login" replace />;
  }
  
  return children || <Outlet />;
}
```

**RequireGuest** - Redirects to `/dashboard` if already authenticated

```jsx
// src/ui/guards/RequireGuest.jsx
import { Navigate, Outlet } from "react-router";
import useAuth from "../../services/hooks/auth/useAuth";

export default function RequireGuest({ children }) {
  const { isAuthenticated, isLoading } = useAuth();
  
  if (isLoading) {
    return (
      <div className="flex h-screen items-center justify-center text-muted-foreground">
        Loading...
      </div>
    );
  }
  
  if (isAuthenticated) {
    return <Navigate to="/dashboard" replace />;
  }
  
  return children || <Outlet />;
}
```

### Auth Rules

1. ✅ **Never store passwords** in state or localStorage
2. ✅ **Use httpOnly cookies** for tokens (backend sets these)
3. ✅ **Call refreshUser()** after profile updates
4. ✅ **Check isLoading** before rendering auth-dependent UI
5. ✅ **Add role checks** in components when needed
6. ✅ **Handle token expiration** gracefully with interceptors

