## 🗄️ State Management

### When to Use Each Approach

| State Type | Tool | Use Case | Example |
|------------|------|----------|---------|
| **Local UI State** | useState | Component-specific state | Form inputs, modals, dropdowns |
| **Shared UI State** | Context API | Cross-component UI state | Theme, sidebar, notifications |
| **Server State** | React Query | API data, caching | User data, analytics, lists |
| **Form State** | React Hook Form | Complex forms with validation | Login, profile, settings |

### Local State Pattern (useState)

