### Environment Variable Rules

1. ✅ **Prefix with VITE_** - required by Vite
2. ✅ **Never commit .env.local** - add to .gitignore
3. ✅ **Document all variables** in .env.example
4. ✅ **Use feature flags** for optional features
5. ✅ **Validate required variables** on app start
6. ✅ **Use different values** for dev/staging/prod

